exports[`상단 바 > 워크스페이스 이름·실제 경로·브랜치, 실행 상태, 엔진별 쿼터 미터 자리 (스냅샷) 1`] = `"<header class="hx-topbar" role="banner"><div class="hx-topbar__ws" data-testid="workspace"><strong class="hx-topbar__name">harness-x</strong><span class="hx-topbar__path hx-mono" title="C:\\agentCli\\harness-x">C:\\agentCli\\harness-x</span><span class="hx-topbar__branch hx-mono" aria-label="브랜치 main">⎇ main</span></div><span class="hx-run hx-run--running" role="status" aria-label="실행 상태: 실행 중"><span class="hx-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>실행 중</span><div class="hx-quotas" aria-label="엔진별 쿼터"><div class="hx-quota" data-engine="claude-code" data-level="ok" title="Claude: 42%"><span class="hx-quota__label">Claude</span><span class="hx-quota__bar" role="meter" aria-label="Claude 쿼터" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="42"><span class="hx-quota__fill" style="width: 42%;"></span></span></div><div class="hx-quota" data-engine="codex" data-level="warning" title="Codex: 93%"><span class="hx-quota__label">Codex</span><span class="hx-quota__bar" role="meter" aria-label="Codex 쿼터" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="93"><span class="hx-quota__fill" style="width: 93%;"></span></span></div><div class="hx-quota" data-engine="antigravity" data-level="unknown" title="Antigravity: 쿼터 정보 없음"><span class="hx-quota__label">Antigravity</span><span class="hx-quota__bar" role="meter" aria-label="Antigravity 쿼터" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100"><span class="hx-quota__fill" style="width: 0%;"></span></span></div></div><button type="button" class="hx-icon-btn" aria-label="테마 바꾸기 (현재: 시스템 테마)" title="시스템 테마" data-theme-pref="system">◐</button></header>"`;

